# Keep offline reference-library checksums stable on Windows checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.apk binary
*.jar binary
# Preserve upstream license bytes, including its intentional trailing spaces.
**/OFL.txt -text whitespace=-blank-at-eol
**/LXGW-WenKai-OFL.txt -text whitespace=-blank-at-eol
**/LICENSE-ATTRIBUTION.md -text
**/reference-library-0.1.0-LICENSE-ATTRIBUTION.md -text
